}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that maximum output occurs.\n\nOn the other hand,\n\n- ${min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the minimum output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that minimum output occurs.\n\nFrom the graph, \n\n- the highest point is at $(2,3),$ so ${max}_{x\\in T}h(x)=3$ and $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in T}h(x)=2,$ and\n\n- the lowest point is at $(3,-2),$ so ${min}_{x\\in T}h(x)=-2$ and $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in T}h(x)=3.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-ec31b80e-9ece-50c3-9bb8-a6d75908d7e1" "answer-field-9768cdc5-dd30-5d0b-9972-ca2147e3f644" "answer-field-75fc930b-6543-5de7-91c2-0be705af88a3" "answer-field-c3305229-fe38-5539-8894-a1f273ecd8d8"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-ec31b80e-9ece-50c3-9bb8-a6d75908d7e1" :answer-field/id #uuid "ec31b80e-9ece-50c3-9bb8-a6d75908d7e1" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-5cd97fce-5da7-5b85-8699-ce5756c736d0" :answer-field/choices ["answer-5cd97fce-5da7-5b85-8699-ce5756c736d0"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5cd97fce-5da7-5b85-8699-ce5756c736d0" :answer/id #uuid "5cd97fce-5da7-5b85-8699-ce5756c736d0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-9768cdc5-dd30-5d0b-9972-ca2147e3f644" :answer-field/id #uuid "9768cdc5-dd30-5d0b-9972-ca2147e3f644" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-e2e1a3cf-acb7-5b75-b3fc-b1f49256ed36" :answer-field/choices ["answer-e2e1a3cf-acb7-5b75-b3fc-b1f49256ed36"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e2e1a3cf-acb7-5b75-b3fc-b1f49256ed36" :answer/id #uuid "e2e1a3cf-acb7-5b75-b3fc-b1f49256ed36" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-75fc930b-6543-5de7-91c2-0be705af88a3" :answer-fi