question-aa3208c3-dd8f-52a7-9e52-31f81d41b1b4" :step/next "step-475846c9-31fa-598e-958f-494404cc26b8" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-475846c9-31fa-598e-958f-494404cc26b8" :step/id #uuid "475846c9-31fa-598e-958f-494404cc26b8" :step/content "question-1bfb5188-7c59-596d-bb0b-41e90d79e407" :db/ensure [:step/validate]}] "assertions" [[17592186231738 :question/problem "| $t$ | $g(t)$ |\n| --- | --- |\n| $-2$ | $3$ |\n| $-1$ | $-4$ |\n| $1$ | $0$ |\n| $2$ | $2$ |\n\nThe table above gives values of a function $g$ on the set $T=\\{-2,-1,1,2\\}.$ Compute the following:\n\n${max}_{t\\in T}g(t)=$\n{{field-1}}\n\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{t\\in T}g(t)=$\n{{field-2}}\n\n${min}_{t\\in T}g(t)=$\n{{field-3}}\n\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{t\\in T}g(t)=$\n{{field-4}}"] [17592186231738 :question/worked-solution "Recall that \n\n- ${max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the maximum output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that maximum output occurs.\n\nOn the other hand,\n\n- ${min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the minimum output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that minimum output occurs.\n\nThe output values are $3,-4,0,$ and $2.$ The maximum output is $3$ (at $t=-2$), and the minimum output is $-4$ (at $t=-1$). \n\nTherefore, we have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{max}_{t\\in T}g(t) & =3 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{t\\in T}g(t) & =-2 \\\\ {min}_{t\\in T}g(t) & =-4 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{t\\in T}g(t) & =-1\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [17592186231738 :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-d549ab47-43a9-5cd4-8652-3ef960a0d2c6" :answer/id #uuid "d549ab47-43a9-5cd4-8652-3ef960a0d2c6"] ["answer-d549ab47-43a9-5cd4-8652-3ef960a0d2c6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-d549ab47-43a9-5cd4-8652-3ef960a0d2c6" :answer/value "3"] [17592186231020 :answer-field/correct "answer-d549ab47-43a9-5cd4-8652-3ef960a0d2c6"] [17592186231020 :answer-field/choices "answer-d549ab47-43a9-5cd4-8652-3ef960a0d2c6"] ["answer-d4794af3-fa88-53e1-9a16-3ebffabb89c1" :answer/id #uuid "d4794af3-fa88-53e1-9a16-3ebffabb89c1"] ["answer-d4794af3-fa88-53e1-9a16-3ebffabb89c1" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-d4794af3-fa88-53e1-9a16-3ebffabb89c1" :answer/value "-2"] [17592186231021 :answer-field/correct "answer-d4794af3-fa88-53e1-9a16-3ebffabb89c1"] [17592186231021 :answer-field/choices "answer-d4794af3-fa88-53e1-9a16-3ebffabb89c1"] ["answer-71bb187a-4f0c-5340-bd4a-6347de5f7e52" :answer/id #uuid "71bb187a-4f0c-5340-bd4a-6347de5f7e52"] ["answer-71bb187a-4f0c-5340-bd4a-6347de5f7e52" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-71bb187a-4f0c-5340-bd4a-6347de5f7e52" :answer/value "-4"] [17592186231023 :answer-field/correct "answer-71bb187a-4f0c-5340-bd4a-6347de5f7e52"] [17592186231023 :answer-field/choices "answer-71bb187a-4f0c-5340-bd4a-6347de5f7e52"] ["answer-4c4a719a-0999-57bd-af30-e365c6399cdd" :answer/id #uuid "4c4a719a-0999-57bd-af30-e365c6399cdd"] ["answer-4c4a719a-0999-57bd-af30-e365c6399cdd" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-4c4a719a-0999-57bd-af30-e365c6399cdd" :answer/value "-1"] [17592186231022 :answer-field/correct "answer-4c4a719a-0999-57bd-af30-e365c6399cdd"] [17592186231022 :answer-field/choices "answer-4c4a719a-0999-57bd-af30-e365c6399cdd"] ["question-872e3e1c-801d-5da3-9c5c-97c11a673f6e" :question/id #uuid "872e3e1c-801d-5da3-9c5c-97c11a673f6e"] ["question-872e3e1c-801d-5da3-9c5c-97c11a673f6e" :question/math-academy-id "q-355233"] ["question-872e3e1c-801d-5da3-9c5c-97c11a673f6e" :question/problem "![](images/4b/4bda4bc11eb5d030d3c9db2336fd8ba98b4c994f2e19f040774225fd275b07e5.png)\n\nLet $T=\\{0,2,3,4,5\\}.$ The graph above shows the value of $h(x)$ for each $x\\in T.$ Assuming that all the dots have integer coordinates, compute the following:\n\n${max}_{x\\in T}h(x)=$\n{{field-1}}\n\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in T}h(x)=$\n{{field-2}}\n\n${min}_{x\\in T}h(x)=$\n{{field-3}}\n\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in T}h(x)=$\n{{field-4}}"] ["question-872e3e1c-801d-5da3-9c5c-97c11a673f6e" :question/worked-solution "Recall that \n\n- ${max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the maximum output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that maximum output occurs.\n\nOn the other hand,\n\n- ${min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the minimum output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that minimum output occurs.\n\nFrom the graph, \n\n- the highest point is at $(2,3),$ so ${max}_{x\\in T}h(x)=3$ and $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in T}h(x)=2,$ and\n\n- the lowest point is at $(3,-2),$ so ${min}_{x\\in T}h(x)=-2$ and $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in T}h(x)=3.$"] ["question-872e3e1c-801d-5da3-9c5c-97c11a673f6e" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-ec31b80e-9ece-50c3-9bb8-a6d75908d7e1" :answer-field/id #uuid "ec31b80e-9ece-50c3-9bb8-a6d75908d7e1"] ["answer-5cd97fce-5da7-5b85-8699-ce5756c736d0" :answer/id #uuid "5cd97fce-5da7-5b85-8699-ce5756c736d0"] ["answer-5cd97fce-5da7-5b85-8699-ce5756c736d0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-5cd97fce-5da7-5b85-8699-ce5756c736d0" :answer/value "3"] ["answer-field-ec31b80e-9ece-50c3-9bb8-a6d75908d7e1" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-ec31b80e-9ece-50c3-9bb8-a6d75908d7e1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-ec31b80e-9ece-50c3-9bb8-a6d75908d7e1" :answer-field/correct "answer-5cd97fce-5da7-5b85-8699-ce5756c736d0"] ["answer-field-ec31b80e-9ece-50c3-9bb8-a6d75908d7e1" :answer-field/choices "answer-5cd97fce-5da7-5b85-8699-ce5756c736d0"] ["answer-field-9768cdc5-dd30-5d0b-9972-ca2147e3f644" :answer-field/id #uuid "9768cdc5-dd30-5d0b-9972-ca2147e3f644"] ["answer-e2e1a3cf-acb7-5b75-b3fc-b1f49256ed36" :answer/id #uuid "e2e1a3cf-acb7-5b75-b3fc-b1f49256ed36"] ["answer-e2e1a3cf-acb7-5b75-b3fc-b1f49256ed36" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-e2e1a3cf-acb7-5b75-b3fc-b1f49256ed36" :answer/value "2"] ["answer-field-9768cdc5-dd30-5d0b-9972-ca2147e3f644" :answer-