 S}f(x)$ is the minimum output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that minimum output occurs.\n\nThe output values are $4,-1,7,$ and $-6.$ The maximum output is $7$ (at $t=3$), and the minimum output is $-6$ (at $t=6$). \n\nTherefore, we have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{max}_{t\\in T}h(t) & =7 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{t\\in T}h(t) & =3 \\\\ {min}_{t\\in T}h(t) & =-6 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{t\\in T}h(t) & =6\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-1bfb5188-7c59-596d-bb0b-41e90d79e407" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-14091760-d318-52ef-8f7a-1e7f1505bba7" :answer-field/id #uuid "14091760-d318-52ef-8f7a-1e7f1505bba7"] ["answer-876868ab-7914-5326-9f9e-f52520e3fd18" :answer/id #uuid "876868ab-7914-5326-9f9e-f52520e3fd18"] ["answer-876868ab-7914-5326-9f9e-f52520e3fd18" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-876868ab-7914-5326-9f9e-f52520e3fd18" :answer/value "7"] ["answer-field-14091760-d318-52ef-8f7a-1e7f1505bba7" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-14091760-d318-52ef-8f7a-1e7f1505bba7" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-14091760-d318-52ef-8f7a-1e7f1505bba7" :answer-field/correct "answer-876868ab-7914-5326-9f9e-f52520e3fd18"] ["answer-field-14091760-d318-52ef-8f7a-1e7f1505bba7" :answer-field/choices "answer-876868ab-7914-5326-9f9e-f52520e3fd18"] ["answer-field-ecf45cf3-40ef-52e7-9ec6-57d10541f220" :answer-field/id #uuid "ecf45cf3-40ef-52e7-9ec6-57d10541f220"] ["answer-bad574c3-61ab-5018-b7c2-e81c899ee288" :answer/id #uuid "bad574c3-61ab-5018-b7c2-e81c899ee288"] ["answer-bad574c3-61ab-5018-b7c2-e81c899ee288" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-bad574c3-61ab-5018-b7c2-e81c899ee288" :answer/value "3"] ["answer-field-ecf45cf3-40ef-52e7-9ec6-57d10541f220" :answer-field/key "field-2"] ["answer-field-ecf45cf3-40ef-52e7-9ec6-57d10541f220" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-ecf45cf3-40ef-52e7-9ec6-57d10541f220" :answer-f